A quoted term takes a lazy line

```
> :: t
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <dl>
    <dt>t
tail</dt>
  </dl>
</blockquote>
```

```
> - :: t
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <dl>
        <dt>t
tail</dt>
      </dl>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
- > :: term
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <dl>
        <dt>term
tail</dt>
      </dl>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```
